//! Browser-executed BabyBear proof placement checkpoint.
//!
//! The compute pass derives a four-row Q12 Mandelbrot witness through the
//! production proof kernel, projects all 17 main and 411 Fe-derived auxiliary
//! columns into one column-major tape, and interprets one Conal factor
//! vocabulary as 428 staged 4-to-16 BabyBear coset LDEs. The production main
//! and auxiliary codewords are committed into one ordered AIR transcript.
//! Eight type-branded placement stages then evaluate the same 708-constraint
//! composition denotation used by the scalar prover, commit all 16 quartic
//! evaluations, and bind that root into the FRI transcript. One Fe-authored
//! round interpreter
//! then places the complete `16 -> 8 -> 4 -> 2 -> 1` FRI schedule. Each round
//! derives its own transcript challenge, folds independent pairs, commits the
//! resulting quartic evaluations, retains their exact ordered Merkle tree,
//! and binds the layer root into the next transcript. The semantic schedule,
//! round domains, pair operation, and Poseidon operations are shared with the
//! scalar proof. A typed query plan then samples one final-transcript index and
//! extracts the seven committed evaluations and six ordered authentication
//! siblings needed to check every retained FRI layer. Thin actor passes
//! specialize only physical round capacities.
//! Per-invocation progress cursors make repeated dispatch race-free without a
//! host-owned dispatch index. A Fe-authored mutation changes one round-one
//! evaluation after the clean root is fixed; later challenges must diverge
//! only through the authenticated transcript chain. The fragment pass
//! visualizes the retained full fold schedule and status words.
//!
//! This is a mixed placement checkpoint. All 428 independent AIR columns use
//! the portable stage-grid interpretation of canonical Conal factor trees. The
//! paired commitment and FRI hash states are a second workgroup-map
//! interpretation. Witness generation and final comparison remain scalar
//! passes. The compact four-column commitment remains diagnostic evidence, but
//! FRI now starts from the full production AIR composition transcript. This is
//! not yet a shared-memory butterfly interpreter, a production 114-query GPU
//! receipt, or a recursive proof.

